                        "review": "Zoo Corporation owns several sub-brands of horny factories generating a stiff stream of horny VNs. But one day they decided to recycle some of the assets from those VNs into classic simple non-horny games. The first one is Mahjong Pretty Girls Battle, but this game is the first one in the Mahjong Solitaire genre.\n\nMahjong solitaire is a solitaire game with very not-obvious weird rules, and with confusing game pieces. Instead of the european playing cards simplified to be as readable as it can be, mahjong uses pieces with more elaborate pictures on them, and even the simple numbered ones instead of suits and colours, are split between noisy designs. Yet instead of traditional mahjong tiles, this game uses petal, peacock, maple leaf, and an owl.\n\nYoung people live their lives born into the dead internet filled with AI slop, where they can instantly find the rules of the game, but just 20 years ago the internet was only for the ultra-rich, was small, and most of the information was hidden. I remember struggling to grasp the rules for years when i was still young.\n\nThis version of mahjong solitaire is fully random, you can easily get a field with literally only one match. No reshuffles. Often the fields will end with the last two matches being mutually interlocked. So it’s all just a matter of luck, instead of a matter of skill. Solitaire started as literally a self-scam to read the future. But when the humanity on average became smarter than that, more people started to enjoy the genre as a game, so it’s not unreasonable to demand from a game to be a game of skill, instead of a game of luck. Especially when this one has clear progression, a limited number of levels, and the end-result.\n\nThis game is basically what it says on the tin. It’s a mahjong solitaire too horny to be normal but not horny enough to be horny. As a mahjong engine it’s mediocre. If you want a mahjong solitaire game to mahjong solitaire it until completion it is a mahjong solitaire game.\n\nYou can get any free mahjong solitaire generator on the web, but some can only get off to ownership. Both to ownership as a paying customers, and to ownership by the publisher who takes the full responsibility for a fully commercial game, which actually exists, and is released. As opposed to some cobbled together web site. And, well, some just actually want sexualized non-nude 2D pictures with sound bytes ripper from a horn game during horn scenes combined with the damn mahjong solitaire.\n\nAs for the characters after some research i’ve found all of the original games they are coming from.\n\nKaichou Rin 会長凛\nクール会長凛のいいなり一週間 ～破廉恥命令で恋人子作り好きのスケベ子宮になってしまう!～\n\nAmamiya Risa 雨宮理沙\n世話好きツンツン幼馴染をコス甘子作りでエロデレに！～もう、変態！…でも大好き…孕ませてよね！～\n\nMatsuura Kanon 松浦かのん\nキモメンでも巨根なら国民的アイドルグループをハーレムにできる!? ～極上マ○コを独り占め！射精しまくり孕ま総選挙♪～\n\nKuwashima Erina 桑島絵里奈\nもしも水泳部顧問の妻がデカパイ肉オナホとして裏サイトで晒されていたら\n\nKirishima Ayame 霧島あやめ\nヤンキー彼女と子作り学園ライフ ～好きとか言うな！ぶっとばすぞ！お前の赤ちゃん欲しくなっちまうだろうが…っ～\n\nThe achievements only track progression, and all are in the working order.",
